<title>USA: Bandag to take stake in franchise network.</title>
<headline>Bandag to take stake in franchise network.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCATINE, Iowa 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bandag Inc said Monday it agreed to acquire a minority interest in Southern Tire Mart Inc, which operates 18 Bandag franchises. Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Bandag makes retreading materials and equipment for a network of over 1,300 franchised dealers who produce and market cold process retreads.</p>
<p>		 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
